      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/hits.md",
      "line": 1703
    },
    {
      "text": "Our client's experience left me with a simple priority.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/hits.md",
      "line": 1705
    },
    {
      "text": "Marketing budgets should pay for problems we can demonstrate, not rules we can merely count.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/hits.md",
      "line": 1707
    },
    {
      "text": "It is not a failure, it is a signal.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/hits.md",
      "line": 1709
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the whole ask.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/hits.md",
      "line": 481
    },
    {
      "text": "We rebuilt the onboarding flow over two weekends and shipped it on a Tuesday. That mattered.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/hits.md",
      "line": 483
    },
    {
      "text": "The timing counts.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/hits.md",
      "line": 485
    },
    {
      "text": "That mattered enough that the judge ordered a new hearing.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "no-hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/no-hits.md",
      "line": 443
    },
    {
      "text": "Run the migration first. It works on Postgres 15 and later.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "no-hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/no-hits.md",
      "line": 445
    },
    {
      "text": "The difference matters when regulators look at the filing.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/hits.md",
      "line": 487
    },
    {
      "text": "That counts as a full day under the policy, so you accrue eight hours.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "no-hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/no-hits.md",
      "line": 447
    },
    {
      "text": "The detail matters for anyone reading the label.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/hits.md",
      "line": 489
    },
    {
      "text": "The order of the arguments matters because the parser is positional.",
