      "bucket": "no-hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/no-hits.md",
      "line": 449
    },
    {
      "text": "The gap lasted.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/hits.md",
      "line": 491
    },
    {
      "text": "It matters that the sample was drawn before treatment began.",
