      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/hits.md",
      "line": 493
    },
    {
      "text": "That sticks to the pan unless you preheat the oil.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "no-hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/no-hits.md",
      "line": 453
    },
    {
      "text": "The distinction matters when auditors reconstruct the sequence.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/hits.md",
      "line": 495
    },
    {
      "text": "That holds only while the lock is active.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "no-hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/no-hits.md",
      "line": 455
    },
    {
      "text": "The invoice was sent to the Berlin office, not the Hamburg office, on March 3.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
      "bucket": "no-hits",
      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/no-hits.md",
      "line": 814
    },
    {
      "text": "Teach the child in front of you, not the child in the parenting book.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/hits.md",
      "line": 1735
    },
    {
      "text": "Not only did the build fail, it failed silently on three runners.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
      "bucket": "no-hits",
      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/no-hits.md",
      "line": 816
    },
    {
      "text": "Answer the question the customer asked, not the question you prepared for.",
