      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/no-hits.md",
      "line": 818
    },
    {
      "text": "Train for the race you entered, not the race you imagined.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/hits.md",
      "line": 1739
    },
    {
      "text": "Not just the frontend broke; the queue worker stopped consuming too.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
      "bucket": "no-hits",
      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/no-hits.md",
      "line": 820
    },
    {
      "text": "Choose the tool your team understands, not the tool the conference praised.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/hits.md",
      "line": 1741
    },
    {
      "text": "The deadline is the 15th, not the 30th.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
      "bucket": "no-hits",
      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/no-hits.md",
      "line": 822
    },
    {
      "text": "Trust the data you collected, not the data you were shown.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/hits.md",
      "line": 1743
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep the rule that prevents harm, not the rule that prevents embarrassment.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/hits.md",
      "line": 1745
    },
    {
      "text": "The tenant pays for water, not heating, under this lease.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
