      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/no-hits.md",
      "line": 824
    },
    {
      "text": "It is not a compromise, it is a choice.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/syntactic-patterns/hits.md",
      "line": 1747
    },
    {
      "text": "The refund goes to the original card, not store credit.",
      "family": "syntactic-patterns",
