      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/hits.md",
      "line": 499
    },
    {
      "text": "The request is simple: approve the invoice so the vendor can start Monday.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "no-hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/no-hits.md",
      "line": 457
    },
    {
      "text": "Reading the transcript brought her hesitation into sharp relief.",
      "family": "phrases",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/phrases/hits.md",
      "line": 469
    },
    {
      "text": "Our bet is on the enterprise tier, which we priced at 2,400 dollars a year.",
