      "bucket": "no-hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/no-hits.md",
      "line": 463
    },
    {
      "text": "The customer's email brought the confusion into focus.",
      "family": "phrases",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/phrases/hits.md",
      "line": 471
    },
    {
      "text": "The whole bet rests on one supplier keeping the 14-day lead time.",
