      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/hits.md",
      "line": 515
    },
    {
      "text": "The problem holding a site back can take more work to find.",
      "family": "semantic-thinness",
      "bucket": "hits",
      "source": "cases/semantic-thinness/hits.md",
      "line": 517
    },
    {
      "text": "I've seen that difference shape what a client wanted to work on.",
